I step onto the court.
Kiran is with me.
Sara and Vishnu stand opposite us.
The game begins.
We run fast.
We jump.
The shuttlecock comes to me quickly.
I can hit it well.
Kiran also plays well.
We all laugh together.
Sara looks at me.
Sara says, "Maya, you can play very well."
I smile.
I say thank you to Sara.
Now we are going to play again.
